      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. \n\nActually, I just checked the dashboard and the \"granularity score\" for this summary came back really low. It looks like the automated system flagged it because there aren't enough discrete items to categorize. I know I said not to overdo it, but can you expand the list? \n\nTry to break down the tasks a bit more so the system picks up on the detail, but still try to keep it somewhat professional. Just make sure the bullet point count is higher so it actually gets approved by the manager.",
